WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Narrator: Now Noura.

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:06.400
Narrator: She waits for the instruction - it comes in seconds.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:07.700
Sierra 2: Shelter instruction - move Block C fans calmly to the inner concourse, upper level.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:14.900
Narrator: Then she leads fans calmly inside, away from the glass, helps an older fan, and politely stops a fan filming.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.900
Noura: Please follow me - walk calmly - this way inside.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.900
Noura: Please put the phone away and come inside with us.
